/** EXTREME 선택 시 캐릭터 필터 칩 행 렌더 (그 외 난이도에서는 숨김) */
private updateCharFilterRow() {
  this.charFilterObjects.forEach(o => o.destroy());
  this.charFilterObjects = [];

  if (this.selectedDifficulty !== DifficultyEnum.EXTREME) return;

  const W = this.scale.width;
  const yOff = (this.scale.height - 600) / 2;
  const cy = 145 + yOff;

  const CHIP_W = 32, CHIP_H = 26, GAP = 5;

  type Chip = { id: string | null; label?: string; charId?: string };
  const chips: Chip[] = [
    { id: null, label: '전체' },
    ...this.availableChars.slice(0, 9).map(id => ({ id, charId: id })),
  ];

  const totalW = chips.length * CHIP_W + (chips.length - 1) * GAP;
  let x = W / 2 - totalW / 2 + CHIP_W / 2;

  chips.forEach(chip => {
    const isSel = this.selectedCharFilter === chip.id;

    const bg = this.add.rectangle(x, cy, CHIP_W, CHIP_H, isSel ? 0x334477 : 0x1a1a2e, 1);
    bg.setStrokeStyle(2, isSel ? 0xaaccff : 0x333355);
    bg.setInteractive({ useHandCursor: true });
    bg.on('pointerdown', () => {
      if (this.selectedCharFilter !== chip.id) {
        this.selectedCharFilter = chip.id;
        this.loadLeaderboard();
      }
    });
    this.charFilterObjects.push(bg);

    if (chip.label) {
      const txt = this.add.text(x, cy, chip.label, {
        fontSize: '10px',
        color: isSel ? '#ffffff' : '#667799',
        fontStyle: 'bold',
      }).setOrigin(0.5);
      this.charFilterObjects.push(txt);
    } else if (chip.charId) {
      const charDef = CHARACTERS.find(c => c.id === chip.charId) ?? CHARACTERS[0];
      const icon = this.add.image(x, cy, charDef.imageKey)
        .setDisplaySize(22, 22).setOrigin(0.5);
      if (!isSel) icon.setTint(0x888888);
      this.charFilterObjects.push(icon);
    }

    x += CHIP_W + GAP;
  });
}

