**`showCharSelectOverlay()` — full portrait card overlay with scrolling:**
```typescript
private showCharSelectOverlay() {
  if (this.charOverlayObjects.length > 0) return;
  // DEPTH = 500
  // readyForInput: false initially — set true in onUp (scene-level fires AFTER game object events)
  const scroll = { y: 0, startY: 0, startScrollY: 0, active: false, hasDragged: false, readyForInput: false };
  // NO delayedCall

  // "전체 랭킹" button — NO readyForInput guard (different y position, no ghost click risk)
  allBg.on('pointerup', () => {
    if (scroll.hasDragged) return;
    // ... select all
  });

  // Close button — NO readyForInput guard (y=H-24, far from dropdown at y=145)
  closeBg.on('pointerup', () => { if (!scroll.hasDragged) this.hideCharSelectOverlay(); });

  // SCROLL_TOP = 90+yOff, SCROLL_BOTTOM = H-46
  // GeometryMask for clipping
  const maskGfx = this.add.graphics();
  maskGfx.fillRect(0, SCROLL_TOP, W, scrollAreaH);
  const mask = maskGfx.createGeometryMask();

  const cardContainer = this.add.container(0, 0).setDepth(DEPTH + 1);
  cardContainer.setMask(mask);

  // Cards: CELL_W=90, CELL_H=112, CARD_W=84, CARD_H=106, COLS=4, gridLeft=20
  // Uses char.illustKey for portrait image
  cardBg.on('pointerup', (ptr) => {
    if (!scroll.readyForInput || scroll.hasDragged) return; // ONLY cards have readyForInput guard
    if (ptr.y < SCROLL_TOP || ptr.y > SCROLL_BOTTOM) return;
    // ... select character
  });

  const onDown = (ptr) => { /* scroll tracking */ };
  const onMove = (ptr) => { /* scroll.y update, cardContainer.y = -scroll.y */ };
  const onUp = () => {
    scroll.active = false;
    scroll.readyForInput = true; // KEY: fires after card pointerup, enables next click
  };

  this.input.on('pointerdown', onDown);
  this.input.on('pointermove', onMove);
  this.input.on('pointerup', onUp);

  this.overlayCleanup = () => {
    this.input.off('pointerdown', onDown);
    this.input.off('pointermove', onMove);
    this.input.off('pointerup', onUp);
  };
}
```

**`hideCharSelectOverlay()`:**
